# Theme DIP

- Contracts: `ThemeStorage` and `ThemeApplicator` in `types/theme.types.ts`.
- Create concrete adapters only in `index.tsx` (`createLocalThemeStorage`, `createDocumentThemeApplicator`).
- `App` accepts `applicator` + `storage` and wires `ThemeProvider` — no factory imports in `App`.
- `ThemeToggle` is presentational (props only). `MainLayout` bridges `useTheme` → toggle.
- Do not call `document` / `localStorage` inside the provider or toggle.
